   "gap": "Supply the written derivation, promised by proved=annex:p15.beta-gamma-convolution, of the source rescaling identity int_0^z (z-y)^(alpha-1) y^(beta-1) dlambda(y) = z^(alpha+beta-1) B(beta,alpha) (body l.256-260), on which both gamma-sum routes depend: the substitution y=zu mapping (0,1) onto (0,z) with its measure-scaling factor z (thm:p15-affine-lebesgue with c=z), the factor rewriting (z-zu)^(alpha-1)(zu)^(beta-1)=z^(alpha-1)z^(beta-1)(1-u)^(alpha-1)u^(beta-1), and the bookkeeping z*z^(alpha-1)*z^(beta-1)=z^(alpha+beta-1). The annex (l.307) gives only 'The change y=zu, z>0, similarly gives the exact source rescaling identity' before displaying the outcome. Closable by a supplementary annex proof item in the packet's owned annex file.",
